# Forest mosquito swarm (#645, D151): one mosquito of the cloud, a dot of 1 or 2 px (the author's playtest, 2026-11-27: the
# 5x4 sprites read badly; the hive's stingers are drawn in plain pixels, and so are these). The game draws twenty-eight.
# dark1, dark2: a pale wing and an ink body, then the wing alone (the 20 per second flicker); fed1, fed2: the same with a
# rose body; dead: one dim pixel as it drops; ember: two pixels burning, in the fireball's ramp (Y, O).
# Danger family (#236): ink 0b0814, rose c87896, pale rose wings f0d0dc / d09cac.
